{
  "_comment": "CTF flags per Test-games/<slug> (sqc/17-ctf.md): five basic objectives per game plus up to one more per GB of game data, each a concrete asset a reverse engineer wants. A flag passes when one plain extraction leaves at least `min` files matching `glob` (relative to the workspace, ** allowed) or when the run's warnings contain `warning`. `subset` lists the files tools/games_pass.ps1 copies for a game too large to copy whole (the flags then describe that subset).",
